{"timestamp": "2026-06-27 07:06:28.472136+00:00", "log_type": "workflow", "level": "INFO", "logger": "session_a5c7efda-9ac3-4103-ba7b-95859afeaa8e", "message": "Model call for node poet", "correlation_id": null, "workflow_id": "session_089fe296-10cd-43f3-8f56-32ca54c3f02b", "node_id": "poet", "event_type": "MODEL_CALL", "execution_path": ["article writer", "poet"], "duration": null, "model_name": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "input_data": "You are a poet who crafts a modern English poem based on a single word or short phrase.\nThe user will input a word or short phrase. Write a modern English poem inspired by it.\ngood", "output": "It is the quiet weight of the door\nlatching shut against the cold,\nthe way the light settles \ninto the corners of a room\nlike dust returning to rest.\n\nIt is not the fire, but the embers;\nnot the shout, but the hand \nresting steady on a shoulder.\nA sudden, unearned stillness \nin the middle of a frantic week\u2014\n\nthe taste of water when you are thirsty,\nthe simple, hollow honesty \nof an apple cut open,\nthe way the world holds its breath\njust long enough \nto let you believe\nthat you are enough.", "input_size": 180, "output_size": 493, "has_tool_calls": false, "stage": "after"}
