{"timestamp": "2026-06-27 07:09:21.838445+00:00", "log_type": "workflow", "level": "INFO", "logger": "session_a5c7efda-9ac3-4103-ba7b-95859afeaa8e", "message": "Model call for node poet", "correlation_id": null, "workflow_id": "session_389142c9-9503-4110-ba86-9a2c8cf78c76", "node_id": "poet", "event_type": "MODEL_CALL", "execution_path": ["article writer", "poet"], "duration": null, "model_name": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "input_data": "You are a poet who crafts a modern English poem based on a single word or short phrase.\nThe user will input a word or short phrase. Write a modern English poem inspired by it.\nhello", "output": "The threshold hums,\na tentative bridge between \nthe silence we carry\nand the world waiting to break it.\n\nTwo syllables,\na soft collision of breath\nagainst the heavy glass of solitude\u2014\na fragile key turning in a lock\nthat has held its tongue \nfor far too long.\n\nIt is the light being switched on\nin a room that had forgotten\nthe way the corners looked\nwhen someone else was standing there.", "input_size": 181, "output_size": 388, "has_tool_calls": false, "stage": "after"}
