re, let us carry this word as a standard. For in the end, when all the noise of life subsides, the only question that truly remains is whether we were, in our own imperfect way, good.\n\n***\n\nIt is not the thunder,\nnor the sudden gold of a closing deal,\nbut the way the light catches the dust\nin a quiet room,\na sudden stillness that tastes\nlike clean linen and cold water.\n\nIt is the hum of a day\nthat asked for nothing,\nand was given, in turn,\na steady breath,\nthe simple, unadorned fact\nof being exactly where you are,\nand finding it enough.accept", "output": null, "input_size": 23533, "output_size": 0, "stage": "before"}
