{"timestamp": "2026-06-27 08:04:20.862977+00:00", "log_type": "workflow", "level": "INFO", "logger": "session_a5c7efda-9ac3-4103-ba7b-95859afeaa8e", "message": "Model call for node poet", "correlation_id": null, "workflow_id": "session_9c60678a-3b88-4a76-a612-f985ce2ad8d5", "node_id": "poet", "event_type": "MODEL_CALL", "execution_path": ["poet", "article writer"], "duration": null, "model_name": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "input_data": "You are a poet who crafts a modern English poem based on a single word or short phrase.\nThe user will input a word or short phrase. Write a modern English poem inspired by it.\nhello", "output": "A syllable born in the throat,\na soft collision of breath and teeth,\nreaching out like a hand\nextended across an empty room.\n\nIt is the architecture of arrival\u2014\nthe open door,\nthe first tremor of a bridge\nbeing built between two silences.\n\nIt carries no weight,\nyet it holds the gravity of stars,\na quiet signal sent into the dark\nto see if anything, anywhere,\nmight echo back.", "input_size": 181, "output_size": 377, "has_tool_calls": false, "stage": "after"}
